<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 74.7000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 74.7000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 74.7000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday after 74.2860 on Thursday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Mar 28		  Mar 27</p>
<p> High			     74.9900		 74.3000</p>
<p> Low				74.6000		 74.2499</p>
<p> Open			     74.9900		 74.3000</p>
<p> Close			    74.7000		 74.2860</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  7.090		   9.940</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
